# Session Memory — tqlflashsubmit
**Date**: 2026-04-27 (active arc started 2026-04-25; rolled forward from 2026-04-20–04-26)
**Branch**: master
**Session Focus**: TotalPricer rebrand, top-nav layout, program-scoped rate stacks across email + PDF, enterprise PDF rebuild, direct PDF download, pill-toggle bugfixes, OB pill→API wiring.

## Status
- **Completed:**
  - **TotalPricer brand lock** — Defy / OpenPrice / DEFY CLOUD / Dare to Defy / Powered by DEFY TPO removed from src/. Login + signup hero is "TQL BENCH". Mobile drawer reads "TQL Pricer · Total Quality Lending". Desktop wordmark "TotalPricer".
  - **Top nav layout (sidebar hidden)** — `<aside>` flipped to plain `hidden`. `<main>` no longer carries `lg:ml-[200px]`. Top header has logo + 4 nav buttons (Chat Live Now, New Scenario, Flash Submit, User Admin) + auth cluster behind a vertical divider.
  - **Print PDF auto-downloads** via `/api/rate-quote-pdf` — no print preview, no popup. Server builds with pdf-lib (90px teal header band + 3px Sky Signal stripe, 44pt hero rate/price, APR + P&I stats card, scenario block with alternating row tints, multi-page rate-stack table, 14px column insets so text stays inside shaded rows). Footer shows NMLS + page N of M.
  - **Rate stacks scoped to ONE program** across Print PDF, Email Client Quote, and Send Full Quote. New `collectProgramRateStack(programs, name)` replaces `collectFullRateStack` everywhere user-facing. Send Full Quote modal `allCandidates` now filters to `(p.name === fullQuoteRate.programName)` so the Highlight Rate dropdown, toggle count, and email payload only carry that program's 5–6 rates (was 60+).
  - **Reserve Rate email** rebuilt with `buildReserveRequestEmail()` — TQL brand layout (teal band + Sky Signal stripe, hero rate/price, APR + P&I, raw investor block, broker-contact block, scenario-inputs alternating-row table, rate ladder for the program). Goes FROM `TQL TotalPricer <TQLQuote@tqltpo.com>` TO `lockdesk@tqlend.com`. Subject `RATE RESERVATION — <rate>% @ <price> — <raw investor program>`. Lock Desk sees raw investor names; broker UI never does.
  - **FROM unified** as `TQLQuote@tqltpo.com` across `api/send-email.ts` (default), `api/flash-submit-request.ts`, and `handleRowReserve` override. Verified-domain guard on `tqltpo.com` / `tqlend.com`.
  - **OB pill toggles → API wiring** — `expandedGuidelines.uniqueProperty = !!(isNonWarrantableProject || isMixedUsePML || is5PlusUnits)`, `vacantUnleased = !!isSeasonalProperty`. `ruralProperty / shortTermRental / entityVesting / firstTimeInvestor` switched from `|| false` to `!!f.field`. Clicking those pills now actually changes which OB products are eligible.
  - **Pill-toggle blank-screen bug** — replaced every `<label><input sr-only></label>` with plain `<button type="button" aria-pressed={...}>`. Chrome no longer focus-scrolls. Verified live with gstack: `documentElement.scrollTop` stays 0 after every click.
  - **Chat with a Human** restored to top nav + mobile drawer.
  - **GEMINI_API_KEY** rotated in Vercel (mirrors `.env.local`).
  - **Mobile polish** on quote modals — `text-base sm:text-sm`, `inputMode="email"`, `autoCapitalize="none"`, `py-3` tap targets so iOS doesn't auto-zoom on focus.
- **Next Up:** Validate live PDF + reserve email rendering with a real DSCR scenario; gut-check Lock Desk format; potential v2 of the Send Full Quote modal that lets the rep pick MULTIPLE rates to bundle.
- **Blockers:** None.

