## Key Decisions
- **One unified card UI** for results — same "EXPAND PRICING OPTIONS" card style in broker default (1–2 cards) and admin unlocked (every program with `Raw · Admin` chip).
- **Single admin gate** (`TQLFAITH`) flips `showRawInvestor` — toggles raw investor names AND skips the 99.000–101.750 price-band filter.
- **Rate stack scope** is always the SELECTED program's own ladder. Multi-investor leakage was the #1 brand risk and is eliminated everywhere user-facing.
- **Reserve email is the only place RAW investor data ships** — and only because it goes to Lock Desk.
- **Print PDF is server-side** (pdf-lib via `/api/rate-quote-pdf`) — slim bundle, pixel-precise layout, bypasses print preview.

