## Technical Notes
- **Pill toggles must NOT be `<label><input sr-only></label>`** — Chrome focus-scrolls absolute-positioned hidden inputs into view, corrupting overflow:hidden body layout. Always use `<button type="button" aria-pressed={...}>`.
- **Email FROM domain whitelist** in `api/send-email.ts` — only `tqltpo.com` / `tqlend.com` pass. Anything else falls back to `TQL TotalPricer <TQLQuote@tqltpo.com>`.
- **OB pill flow path**: form pills → formData (boolean) → `buildOBRequest(f)` → `expandedGuidelines.{flagName}: !!f.field`. Hardcoded `false` is the bug pattern to watch for.
- **PDF column insets**: 14px each side, right-aligned columns step left in 70/78px increments from the PAYMENT right edge. Header rect width matches body rect width (`CONTENT_W`).
- **Send Full Quote candidate filter** lives inside the modal IIFE — `if ((p.name || '') !== targetProgramName) continue;` early-out before pushing to `allCandidates`.
- **Mobile-friendly emails**: max-width 600px tables, system-font stack only, inline styles, viewport meta.

